# Ordered XNU patch series for MT6899. One patch per line, paths relative to
# this directory; # starts a comment. An empty series is valid.
#
# The ARM64 and OS series omit two files they assume the SoC series supplies
# (this is how every real UniXNU port does it; see docs .vitepress device
# records for sirius / piano):
#
#   native-smp-secondary.patch  MAX_CPUS 4 -> 8 and Affinity1 core numbering;
#                               MT6899 is 8x Cortex-A725 across clusters.
#   sheng-platform-power.patch  the bsd_init.c PMGR call site that
#                               zzz-boot-progress.patch quotes as context.
#                               XNU_SHENG_PMGR is off for rodin, so the block
#                               compiles to nothing but the context is needed.
native-smp-secondary.patch
sheng-platform-power.patch
